Package: bjlm
Title: Bayesian Joint Longitudinal Modelling
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("Aidan D", "Bindoff", , "aidan.bindoff@utas.edu.au", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-0943-2702"))
Description: Fits Bayesian joint longitudinal models combining propensity-weighted
    and piecewise change-point outcome models. Uses Pólya-Gamma augmented Gibbs
    sampling with a modular cut posterior to prevent outcome-to-propensity
    feedback. Provides a piped declarative API for model specification, subject
    alignment, prior construction, causal effect estimation (G-computation and
    doubly robust AIPW), and census-weighted population inference.
